otal values printed by F04 run up to 9993, within the declared max_total of 10000. The out-of-range values in F30 are a separate defect.\"}, \"centavo_sign\": {\"verdict\": \"PRODUCIBLE\", \"family\": \"F03\", \"template\": \"How is ₱0.{cent_choice} written using the centavo sign?\", \"reasoning\": \"F03 asks the learner to express a centavo amount with the centavo sign. The cent_choice values are 25 and 50, which are the only centavo amounts this family prints.\"}}, \"failing_families\": [\"F01\", \"F02\", \"F04\", \"F05\", \"F06\", \"F07\", \"F09\", \"F13\", \"F14\", \"F15\", \"F16\", \"F17\", \"F18\", \"F19\", \"F20\", \"F21\", \"F22\", \"F23\", \"F26\", \"F28\", \"F30\"], \"failing_templates\": [\"How is '{words} pesos' written using the peso symbol?\", \"How is {cent_choice} centavos written as a decimal of a peso using the ₱ symbol?\", \"How is ₱{total_rw} written in words?\", \"How is ₱{total_rw} written using the currency code PhP?\", \"PhP {total_rw}\", \"PhP{total_rw}c\", \"Remember that pesos use ₱ or PhP, and centavos can be written as a decimal.\", \"{chunk}-{v}\", \"{num_to_words} pesos\", \"{p0} {p1}\", \"{p0} {p1} {p2}\", \"{total_rw} PhP\", \"{total_rw}¢\", \"{v} hundred\", \"{v} thousand\", \"{words} centavos\", \"{words} pesos\", \"₱0.0{cent_choice}\", \"₱{total_rw}\", \"{answer}\", \"{member}\"], \"overall\": \"FAIL\", \"reasoning\": \"(1) Number format: vocabulary.number_format is the space separator for thousands, but the total-driven templates F04, F05, F06, F07, F17, F18, F26 print four-digit totals unspaced (the printed_runs include values such as 1104 and 2034 to 2035), and F28 prints keyed answers unspaced (such as 1175 and 1228). (2) Range: F30 prints members with five digits and more (for example 20120, 69540 and 86450) inside a template that is an 'the generator's own choices' distractor, which exceeds the declared ₱10 000 bound. (3) Malformed money: F23 renders three decimal places after the peso sign (its cent_choice members 25 and 50